{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"docusaurus","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Docusaurus"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Docusaurus builds with webpack, twice: the browser bundle, and the server render\nthat writes each page's HTML. A plugin of a few lines adds Kirana's webpack\nplugin to both, and the two share one compiler session, so a class name is the\nsame in the HTML and in the browser. Tested on every change by\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"examples/docusaurus","source":"examples/docusaurus"}},{"type":"text","value":", built and on its dev server."}]},{"type":"component","name":"npm-status","attributes":{},"children":[]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"the-fast-way","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The fast way"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"In the project's root:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"npx kirana-style@latest init","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style@latest init","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It writes the configuration and the stylesheet's import, and tells you the\nplugin to add (step 2). Then "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style doctor","source":"npx kirana-style doctor"}},{"type":"text","value":" checks the result."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"1-install","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Install"}]},{"type":"component","name":"install","attributes":{"packages":"@kirana-style/core","dev":"@kirana-style/webpack"},"children":[]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"2-add-the-plugin","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Add the plugin"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"import type { Config, Plugin } from \"@docusaurus/types\"\nimport { KiranaPlugin } from \"@kirana-style/webpack\"\n\nfunction kirana(): Plugin {\n  return {\n    name: \"kirana\",\n    configureWebpack: () => ({ plugins: [new KiranaPlugin()] }),\n  }\n}\n\nexport default {\n  // …\n  plugins: [kirana],\n} satisfies Config","lang":"ts","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"th-token th-type\">Config</span>, <span class=\"th-token th-type\">Plugin</span> } <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@docusaurus/types&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"th-token th-type\">KiranaPlugin</span> } <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/webpack&quot;</span>\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"th-token th-function\">kirana</span>(): <span class=\"th-token th-type\">Plugin</span> {\n  <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">return</span> {\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">name</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;kirana&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">configureWebpack</span>: () =&gt; ({ <span class=\"th-token th-property\">plugins</span>: [<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"th-token th-function\">KiranaPlugin</span>()] }),\n  }\n}\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">default</span> {\n  <span class=\"th-token th-comment\">// …</span>\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">plugins</span>: [kirana],\n} <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">satisfies</span> <span class=\"th-token th-type\">Config</span>","file":"docusaurus.config.ts","title":"docusaurus.config.ts"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kirana's loader runs ahead of Docusaurus's own, so it reads "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" before JSX is\ncompiled away."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"3-declare-docusaurus-s-aliases","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. Declare Docusaurus's aliases"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@theme/Layout","source":"@theme/Layout"}},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@docusaurus/Link","source":"@docusaurus/Link"}},{"type":"text","value":" and the rest are webpack aliases that\nNode.js resolution cannot follow. Listed as externals, imports from them are\nruntime values, without an "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"unresolved-import","source":"unresolved-import"}},{"type":"text","value":" warning on every page:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"import { defineConfig } from \"@kirana-style/core/config\"\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  externals: [\n    \"@theme/\",\n    \"@theme-original/\",\n    \"@theme-init/\",\n    \"@site/\",\n    \"@generated/\",\n    \"@docusaurus/\",\n  ],\n})","lang":"ts","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> { defineConfig } <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/core/config&quot;</span>\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"th-token th-function\">defineConfig</span>({\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">externals</span>: [\n    <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@theme/&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@theme-original/&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@theme-init/&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@site/&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@generated/&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@docusaurus/&quot;</span>,\n  ],\n})","file":"kirana.config.mts","title":"kirana.config.mts"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"4-import-the-stylesheet","children":[{"type":"text","value":"4. Import the stylesheet"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"In the theme's "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-type\">Root</span>","source":"Root"}},{"type":"text","value":", which wraps every page (create it if the site has none):"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"import \"@kirana-style/core/stylesheet.css\"\n\nexport default function Root({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <>{children}</>\n}","lang":"tsx","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/core/stylesheet.css&quot;</span>\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"th-token th-function\">Root</span>({ children }: { <span class=\"th-token th-property\">children</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-type\">React</span>.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">ReactNode</span> }) {\n  <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">return</span> &lt;&gt;{children}&lt;/&gt;\n}","file":"src/theme/Root.tsx","title":"src/theme/Root.tsx"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"5-write-a-page","children":[{"type":"text","value":"5. Write a page"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"import { css } from \"@kirana-style/core\"\nimport Layout from \"@theme/Layout\"\n\nconst title = css({ fontSize: \"2rem\", fontWeight: 600 })\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  return (\n    <Layout>\n      <h1 sx={title}>Hello</h1>\n    </Layout>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> { css } <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/core&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"th-token th-type\">Layout</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@theme/Layout&quot;</span>\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">const</span> title = <span class=\"th-token th-function\">css</span>({ <span class=\"th-token th-property\">fontSize</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;2rem&quot;</span>, <span class=\"th-token th-property\">fontWeight</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-number\">600</span> })\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"th-token th-function\">Home</span>() {\n  <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">return</span> (\n    &lt;<span class=\"th-token th-tag\">Layout</span>&gt;\n      &lt;<span class=\"th-token th-tag\">h1</span> <span class=\"th-token th-attr\">sx</span>={title}&gt;Hello&lt;/<span class=\"th-token th-tag\">h1</span>&gt;\n    &lt;/<span class=\"th-token th-tag\">Layout</span>&gt;\n  )\n}","file":"src/pages/index.tsx","title":"src/pages/index.tsx"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Infima, the classic theme's CSS framework, is unlayered: on an element it\nstyles itself (a link's colour, a heading's margin), its rule beats yours.\nStyle your own elements, or wrappers around Infima's, and it does not come up."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"next","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/frameworks/react","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React"}]},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" in React components."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/integrations/webpack","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The webpack plugin"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/config/layers","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Layers"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"docusaurus","text":"Docusaurus","level":1},{"id":"the-fast-way","text":"The fast way","level":2},{"id":"1-install","text":"1. Install","level":2},{"id":"2-add-the-plugin","text":"2. Add the plugin","level":2},{"id":"3-declare-docusaurus-s-aliases","text":"3. Declare Docusaurus's aliases","level":2},{"id":"4-import-the-stylesheet","text":"4. Import the stylesheet","level":2},{"id":"5-write-a-page","text":"5. Write a page","level":2},{"id":"next","text":"Next","level":2}]}
